<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-cmn-Hans">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=0">
<title>奖励规则 | PROVIDENCE</title>
<link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css?v=1763343791">
<style>
.rules-page{background:#f7f8fa;min-height:100vh;padding-bottom:80px}

/* 顶部深蓝渐变（参考积分页面） */
.rules-hero{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0e2b44,#091c2e);
    padding:50px 20px 25px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    color:#fff;
}

.rules-hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at top left,rgba(255,255,255,0.08),transparent 60%),
               radial-gradient(circle at bottom right,rgba(212,175,55,0.08),transparent 60%);
    opacity:0.8;
}

.rules-back{color:#fff;font-size:28px;cursor:pointer;position:static}
.rules-title{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#f5d771;margin:0 0 4px;text-align:left}
.rules-subtitle{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin:0;text-align:left}

/* 卡片样式 */
.rules-content{padding:16px}
.rule-section{
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:16px;
    margin-bottom:12px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
}

.section-title{
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:#1a1a1a;
    margin:0 0 12px;
    padding-bottom:8px;
    border-bottom:2px solid #f0f0f0;
}

.rule-text{font-size:14px;color:#444;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:400}
.rule-text p{margin:0 0 8px}
.rule-text strong{color:#d4af37;font-weight:600}

.rule-highlight{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(212,175,55,0.08),rgba(212,175,55,0.05));
    border-left:3px solid #d4af37;
    padding:12px;
    border-radius:8px;
    margin:10px 0;
}

.highlight-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4af37;margin:0 0 6px}
.highlight-text{font-size:13px;color:#555;line-height:1.7;margin:0;font-weight:400}

.reward-list{margin:10px 0}
.reward-item{
    display:flex;
    align-items:flex-start;
    gap:10px;
    padding:10px;
    background:#fafafa;
    border-radius:8px;
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.reward-icon{font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0}
.reward-content{flex:1}
.reward-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#333;margin:0 0 4px}
.reward-desc{font-size:12px;color:#999;margin:0}

.warning-box{
    background:#fff5f5;
    border:1px solid #ffccc7;
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:12px;
    margin:10px 0;
}

.warning-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#ff4d4f;margin:0 0 6px}
.warning-text{font-size:12px;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin:0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="app" class="rules-page">
    <div class="rules-hero">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;">
            <div class="rules-back" onclick="history.back()">‹</div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="rules-title">🌐 推广与佣金奖励规则</h1>
                <p class="rules-subtitle">诚信推广 · 合规经营 · 共同成长</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rules-content">
        <!-- 层级关系 -->
        <div class="rule-section">
            <div class="section-title">一、层级关系定义</div>
            <div class="rule-text">
                <p><strong>一级关系：</strong>当用户 A 直接推荐用户 B 注册时，B 为 A 的一级下线。</p>
                <p><strong>二级关系：</strong>若用户 B 再推荐用户 C 注册，则 C 为 A 的二级下线。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-highlight">
                <div class="highlight-title">⚠️ 层级限制</div>
                <div class="highlight-text">系统仅计算两级关系。用户 C 若再推荐用户 D，A 与 D 不存在佣金关系。该层级关系是面向中国大陆金融市场的合规化营销架构。</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 佣金奖励 -->
        <div class="rule-section">
            <div class="section-title">二、佣金奖励机制</div>

            <div class="reward-list">
                <div class="reward-item">
                    <div class="reward-icon" style="font-size:20px">🎁</div>
                    <div class="reward-content">
                        <div class="reward-title">1. 推广奖励（首投奖励）</div>
                        <div class="reward-desc">当用户成功邀请新用户注册并完成首次投资（首投）后：</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-text" style="padding-left:36px">
                <p style="margin:4px 0">• 推荐人将获得被推荐人首投金额 <strong>1%</strong> 的奖励；</p>
                <p style="margin:4px 0">• 奖励将在项目到期结算后发放至推荐人的佣金账户。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="reward-list" style="margin-top:20px">
                <div class="reward-item">
                    <div class="reward-icon" style="font-size:20px">💎</div>
                    <div class="reward-content">
                        <div class="reward-title">2. 团队奖励（持续佣金）</div>
                        <div class="reward-desc">在下线用户进行任何投资时，推荐人可获得如下比例的团队佣金：</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-text" style="padding-left:36px">
                <p style="margin:4px 0">• 一级佣金：一级下线每笔投资金额的 <strong>0.5%</strong>；</p>
                <p style="margin:4px 0">• 二级佣金：二级下线每笔投资金额的 <strong>0.2%</strong>。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="rule-highlight" style="margin-top:16px">
                <div class="highlight-title">⚠️ 佣金产生规则</div>
                <div class="highlight-text">佣金仅在下线发生真实投资行为后产生，若投资撤销、退款或违规操作，系统将自动回收对应佣金。</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 佣金结算 -->
        <div class="rule-section">
            <div class="section-title">三、佣金结算与发放</div>
            <div class="rule-text">
                <p>佣金将在下线用户投资项目到期结算后，自动计入推荐人的<strong>【佣金账户】</strong>。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="highlight-title" style="color:#d4af37;margin:12px 0 8px;">💎 佣金可用于：</div>
            <div class="reward-list">
                <div class="reward-item">
                    <div class="reward-icon">💸</div>
                    <div class="reward-content">
                        <div class="reward-title">直接提现</div>
                        <div class="reward-desc">实时到账，灵活使用</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="reward-item">
                    <div class="reward-icon">🔄</div>
                    <div class="reward-content">
                        <div class="reward-title">投资项目复投</div>
                        <div class="reward-desc">收益再投资，复利增长</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="reward-item">
                    <div class="reward-icon">🎁</div>
                    <div class="reward-content">
                        <div class="reward-title">抵扣平台手续费</div>
                        <div class="reward-desc">降低投资成本</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rule-text" style="margin-top:12px;">
                系统将实时计算并在"我的团队 / 我的推广"中展示佣金明细与层级结构。
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 合规提示 -->
        <div class="rule-section">
            <div class="section-title">四、合规与风险提示</div>
            <div class="rule-text">
                <p>✓ 本制度仅限用于平台内部推广激励，不构成任何形式的多层营销或返利活动。</p>
                <p>✓ 平台严格限定奖励层级（最多两级），以确保合规性与透明性。</p>
                <p>✓ 若发现用户存在虚假注册、刷单等违规行为，平台有权撤销其佣金及推广资格。</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 简版规则 -->
        <div class="rule-section" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbf0,#fff9e6);border:2px solid #d4af37">
            <div class="section-title" style="color:#d4af37">💰 推广奖励规则（简版）</div>
            <div class="rule-text" style="color:#666">
                <p>用户成功邀请好友注册并完成首投，可获得好友首投金额 <strong style="color:#d4af37">1%</strong> 的推广奖励。</p>
                <p>此外，推荐人还可获得：</p>
                <p>• 一级下线投资额 <strong style="color:#d4af37">0.5%</strong> 的团队佣金</p>
                <p>• 二级下线投资额 <strong style="color:#d4af37">0.2%</strong> 的团队佣金</p>
                <p style="margin-top:12px;">佣金在项目到期结算后自动发放至"佣金账户"。仅限两级关系，超过二级不计佣金。</p>
                <p style="color:#ff4d4f;margin-top:8px;">平台严禁虚假注册、循环邀请等违规行为，一经发现将取消推广资格。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 底部导航 -->
    <nav class="tabbar">
        <a class="tab" href="index.html">
            <div class="ico ico-home"></div>
            <div class="txt">首页</div>
        </a>
        <a class="tab" href="market.html">
            <div class="ico ico-finance"></div>
            <div class="txt">数据</div>
        </a>
        <a class="tab" href="finance.html">
            <div class="ico ico-market"></div>
            <div class="txt">项目</div>
        </a>
        <a class="tab" href="messages.html">
            <div class="ico dot ico-message"></div>
            <div class="txt">消息</div>
        </a>
        <a class="tab" href="profile.html">
            <div class="ico ico-me"></div>
            <div class="txt">我的</div>
        </a>
    </nav>
</div>
</body>
</html>
